f:T469,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BlogPosting","headline":"Email Marketing Benchmarks 2026: Open Rates, Click-Through Rates & Bounce Rates by Industry","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Amy Foster"},"datePublished":"2026-05-26","description":"In 2026, email marketing remains the highest-ROI digital channel—but rising inbox filtering standards, stricter authentication mandates, and AI-powered engagement scoring have redefined what 'good' performance means. Based on EmailCompare.net’s analysis of 14.2 billion emails sent across 32,789 brands in Q1 2026, average open rates have declined 12.4% year-over-year while click-through rates rose 8.7%, signaling a fundamental shift from volume-driven to intent-driven engagement. This report delivers rigorously validated, industry-specific benchmarks for open rates, CTR, and bounce rates—and reveals how top-performing brands are adapting to Google and Yahoo’s mandatory sender requirements, universal DMARC enforcement, and BIMI adoption rates now exceeding 31% among Fortune 500 senders.","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Email Marketing Tools Hub"}}4:["$","div",null,{"className":"relative pt-32 pb-20","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$f"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Email Marketing Tools Hub\",\"url\":\"https://emailcompare.net\",\"description\":\"Comprehensive email marketing directory and tool hub for modern enterprises.\"}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6","children":[["$","$L10",null,{"href":"/blog","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[#BE8A83] hover:text-[#E63946] transition-colors mb-8","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","