24:["$","p","35",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["While open rates declined across the board, CTR increased meaningfully—indicating that recipients who *do* engage are doing so more intentionally. This reflects improved segmentation, dynamic content personalization (now deployed by 78% of top-quartile senders), and tighter alignment between subject line, preheader, and landing page."]}]
